OL,3,GNEWSAWoman marks 45 years of working at
OL,4,AButlin's
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My husband says if you cut me in half,
OL,7,FI'd have Butlin's running through me
OL,8,Flike a stick of rock."
OL,10,FLinda Carroll, from Minehead in
OL,11,FSomerset, is marking a major milestone
OL,12,Fafter working at the holiday resort in
OL,13,Fthe town for 45 years.
OL,15,FShe became a permanent staff member in
OL,16,FAugust 1981 and has held various job
OL,17,Ftitles since. "I've met so many lovely
OL,18,Fpeople along the way too, many of whom
OL,19,Fhave become lifelong friends from all
OL,20,Fover the country," she said.
