OL,3,GNEWSAWoman marks 45 years of working at
OL,4,AButlin's
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Goodwin, resort director at
OL,7,FButlin's Minehead, said: "Reaching 45
OL,8,Fsummers at Butlin's is an extraordinary
OL,9,Fmilestone and Linda has been part of
OL,10,Flife at Minehead for generations."
